    Bug 279366 - Fix FCC2 handling when saving a message as draft. r=john.bieling,mkmelin

    - Save a copy to an additional folder only if the message is actually sent or queued for sending later.
    - Ensure that the current draft is replaced in the drafts folder when FCC2 is set and the message is saved again.
    - This also prevents the additional CC folder from becoming a drafts folder when a message is saved with FCC2 set.

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D242713

